Query:
    []int: items
    int: wanted
    return: @
    run:
        int: i 0
        while: i < length(items)
            if: (items[i] > 0) = wanted
                return: (wanted; i + 1)
            i += 1
        return: (1 - wanted; i)

Example:
    []int: items
    return: @
    run:
        return: (copy(Query\run(items; 1)) copy(Query\run(items; 0)))
